Inline math :math:`x^{2} + y^{2} = z^{2}` inside a sentence.

.. math:: \sum_{i = 1}^{n}i = \frac{n(n + 1)}{2}

Fractions and roots: :math:`\frac{a}{b}`, :math:`\sqrt{x}`,
:math:`\sqrt[3]{x}`.

Matrices:

.. math::

   \begin{pmatrix}
   1 & 2 \\
   3 & 4
   \end{pmatrix}

Cases:

.. math::

   \begin{cases}
   x\text{ if }y \\
   z\text{ otherwise}
   \end{cases}
